itksnap (4.4.0~beta2-1~noble2) noble; urgency=medium

  * Build against system jsoncpp (0005-use-system-jsoncpp.patch): the
    bundled 0.10.6 copy plus VTK's system libjsoncpp.so.25 put two
    jsoncpp ABIs in one process, causing a duplicate-symbol segfault at
    startup. Add pkg-config Build-Dep.
  * Install a .desktop entry + icon for menu integration; add lintian
    overrides for the vendored libs and missing man pages.

 -- Morgan Hough <morgan.hough@gmail.com>  Sat, 11 Jul 2026 09:28:02 -0700

itksnap (4.4.0~beta2-1~noble1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian/NeuroDebian packaging (ported from the neurofedora
    itksnap.spec). Built against the system InsightToolkit5 5.4.6 (which
    provides the MorphologicalContourInterpolation remote module ITK-SNAP needs)
    and system VTK + Qt 6.
  * Vendor the c3d, greedy and digestible submodules (pinned commits) into
    Submodules/; back-port the GCC 15 std::cout fix; skip the git-commit-date
    call for tarball builds.

